{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Hardwood is a resource. It is obtained by chopping down a ",["l","桃花心木树","Mahogany Tree"]," or a ",["l","神秘树","Mystic Tree"]," with any ",["l","斧头","axe"],", a ",["l","大树桩","Large Stump"]," with a ",["l","斧头","Copper Axe"]," or better, or a ",["l","大圆木","Large Log"]," with a ",["l","斧头","Steel Axe"]," or better."]],["p",["Six ",["l","大树桩","Large Stump"],"s respawn daily in the ",["l","秘密森林","Secret Woods"],", making it possible to obtain 12 Hardwood per day. Eight Large Stumps respawn daily on the left side of the ",["l","农场地图","Forest Farm Map"],", and one Large Stump respawns daily in the top left corner of the ",["l","农场地图","Four Corners Farm Map"],". These yield an additional 16 and 2 Hardwood per day, respectively."]],["p",["On ",["l","姜岛","Ginger Island"],", there are wild ",["l","桃花心木树","Mahogany Tree"],"s that will regrow after being chopped for Hardwood. Hardwood is also readily available from various trees, stumps, and logs (using the appropriate ",["l","斧头","axes"],") on Floors 41-69 of ",["l","矿井","the Dangerous Mines"],". All ",["l","树","trees"]," have a chance of dropping Hardwood with the ",["l","采集","Lumberjack Profession"],"; this can be done with any axe or any ",["l","打造","bombs"],"."]],["p",["Hardwood can also be received as loot by breaking ",["l","矿井","barrels and boxes"]," in ",["l","矿井","the Mines"]," or ",["l","骷髅洞穴","Skull Cavern"],". ",["l","罗宾","Robin"]," may gift the player 25 Hardwood at the ",["l","冬日星盛宴","Feast of the Winter Star"],". It can also be gifted by a ",["l","动物","pet"]," dog with max ",["l","动物","friendship"],". A ",["l","木跃鱼","Woodskip"]," ",["l","鱼塘","Fish Pond"]," may produce 5 Hardwood when the population of the pond reaches 6. Ten Hardwood may be received from opening a ",["l","谜之盒","Mystery Box"],". Up to 100 Hardwood can be purchased from ",["l","莉亚","Leah"],"'s ",["l","沙漠节","shop"]," at the ",["l","沙漠节","Desert Festival"]," for 3 Calico Eggs ",["l","卡利科三花蛋","Calico Egg"],"s each. The ",["l","书摊老板","Bookseller"]," trades 20 Hardwood for 1 ",["l","伐木秘事","Woody's Secret"],", provided the player has already obtained the power from that book."]]]],["Crafting",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Image"]},{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Description"]},{"h":1,"v":["Ingredients"]},{"h":1,"v":["Recipe Source"]}],[[["f","Cheese_Press.png",48]],[["l","压酪机","Cheese Press"]],["Turns milk into cheese."],[["i","(O)709","Hardwood ×10"],["i","(O)388","Wood ×45"],["i","(O)390","Stone ×45"],["i","(O)334","Copper Bar ×1"]],[["f","Farming_Skill_Icon.png",24]," ",["l","耕种","Farming"]," Level 6"]],[[["f","Oil_Maker.png",48]],[["l","产油机","Oil Maker"]],["Makes gourmet truffle oil."],[["i","(O)709","Hardwood ×20"],["i","(O)766","Slime ×50"],["i","(O)336","Gold Bar ×1"]],[["f","Farming_Skill_Icon.png",24]," ",["l","耕种","Farming"]," Level 8"]],[[["f","Hardwood_Fence.png",48]],[["l","硬木围栏","Hardwood Fence"]],["The most durable type of fence."],[["i","(O)709","Hardwood ×1"]],[["f","Farming_Skill_Icon.png",24]," ",["l","耕种","Farming"]," Level 6"]],[[["f","Worm_Bin.png",48]],[["l","虫饵盒","Worm Bin"]],["Produces bait on a regular basis. The worms are self-sufficient."],[["i","(O)709","Hardwood ×15"],["i","(O)336","Gold Bar ×1"],["i","(O)335","Iron Bar ×1"],["i","(O)771","Fiber ×50"]],[["f","Fishing_Skill_Icon.png",24]," ",["l","钓鱼","Fishing"]," Level 4"]],[[["f","Cork_Bobber.png",48]],[["l","软木塞浮标","Cork Bobber"]],["Slightly increases the size of your \"fishing bar\"."],[["i","(O)709","Hardwood ×5"],["i","(O)388","Wood ×10"],["i","(O)766","Slime ×10"]],[["f","Fishing_Skill_Icon.png",24]," ",["l","钓鱼","Fishing"]," Level 7"]],[[["f","Mushroom_Log.png",48]],[["l","蘑菇树桩","Mushroom Log"]],["Grows mushrooms every so often. The more wild trees are nearby, the better it works."],[["i","(O)709","Hardwood ×10"],["i","(O)Moss","Moss ×10"]],[["f","Foraging_Skill_Icon.png",24]," ",["l","采集","Foraging"]," Level 4"]],[[["f","Warp_Totem_Beach.png",48]],[["l","传送图腾：海滩","Warp Totem: Beach"]],["Warp directly to the bea